1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,800
Something runs across your shoe.
Small. Fast. Squeaking.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,267
Okay. That rat was huge.

3
00:00:06,967 --> 00:00:07,900
Not today, rat.

4
00:00:09,367 --> 00:00:11,567
Keep moving. It's more scared of us.
Good.

5
00:00:12,267 --> 00:00:16,167
9:00 PM. Four hundred yards behind
you. Four hundred to go.

6
00:00:16,867 --> 00:00:20,333
Rule twelve. The strongest walks last.
Jax, you're our tail.

7
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:22,100
Me? Why me?

8
00:00:23,433 --> 00:00:27,333
Because the last guy gets left behind
first. And nobody's leaving you.

9
00:00:28,033 --> 00:00:29,700
Okay. I've got the back.
